00:05:48.800 --> 00:05:52.240
to use a big font size with three

00:05:50.640 --> 00:05:54.360
pictures per story. But, if you're

00:05:52.240 --> 00:05:56.640
targeting older kids, you might want to

00:05:54.360 --> 00:05:58.520
make them longer. But, either way,

00:05:56.640 --> 00:06:01.200
Claude was able to easily adapt to this

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:03.400
request and it wrote me my story, no

00:06:01.200 --> 00:06:05.680
problem. So, again, I asked it to carry

00:06:03.400 --> 00:06:07.840
on now and write story two for me. And

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:10.240
again, it did it no problem. And I just

00:06:07.840 --> 00:06:13.520
kept repeating this process until I had

00:06:10.240 --> 00:06:15.800
all 15 stories. Now, this next step is

00:06:13.520 --> 00:06:18.400
optional, but Claude has multiple types

00:06:15.800 --> 00:06:20.760
of models. So, as I said earlier, Sonnet

00:06:18.400 --> 00:06:23.200
is the mid-tier model, but it also has a

