but what I like to do is to use this

00:06:29.600 --> 00:06:33.960
more advanced model to polish my stories

00:06:31.800 --> 00:06:36.160
and to make them even better. So, to do

00:06:33.960 --> 00:06:38.560
that, I start a new chat in the project

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:40.680
and upload my story I wanted to edit and

00:06:38.560 --> 00:06:42.880
I tell it to take that story and to make

00:06:40.680 --> 00:06:45.120
it more entertaining and fun to read and

00:06:42.880 --> 00:06:47.200
