00:07:30.080 --> 00:07:34.200
And then, next, I usually pick to make

00:07:31.960 --> 00:07:36.160
four images to give myself multiple to

00:07:34.200 --> 00:07:38.840
pick from. And then, out of the two AI

00:07:36.160 --> 00:07:41.520
models, honestly, Nano Banana 2 or Nano

00:07:38.840 --> 00:07:43.480
Banana Pro work fine for kids images, so

00:07:41.520 --> 00:07:45.240
you can pick either. Then, just type in

00:07:43.480 --> 00:07:47.080
what you want your image to feature and

00:07:45.240 --> 00:07:50.120
what style you want it in, and that's

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:52.760
it. Now, I asked for a modern 2D studio

00:07:50.120 --> 00:07:54.720
aesthetic as this is a very trendy style

00:07:52.760 --> 00:07:56.880
